  (text "USB / XMOS NOTES\n- U203 XU316-1024-QF60B symbol has FUNCTION names only. Pin numbers are placeholders (?nn):\n  replace with XMOS official Altium library part before PCB. Assign I2S/GPIO to ports in the .xn file.\n  Known from datasheet: USB_DM=28, USB_DP=29, USB_VDD33=30, USB_VDD18=31. Core VDD = 0.9 V (0.855-0.945).\n- QSPI boot flash on the X0D01/X0D04-07/X0D10 pins (check boot-mode straps in the datasheet).\n- U202 STUSB4500: NVM PDO3=15V/1.5A, PDO2=12V/1.5A, PDO1=5V. VBUS_EN_SNK drives load switch Q201.\n- MCLK: X202 24.576 MHz / X203 22.5792 MHz selected by U205 (S=0 -> 48k family).\n- J202 debug header pinout is a placeholder: match it to your XTAG adapter."
    (at 20 380 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.524 1.524)
      )
      (justify left top)
    )
    (uuid "94f56da2-a029-53d5-8891-81087d1330ad")
  )
